Scope. This license (zlib, the same as LÖVE itself) covers the code written for this port:
love-ps4/, tools/, deps/*.sh, deps/sdl2-config/, logs/udplog.py, testgame/ and the patch
scripts in patches/*.py.

tools/make-pkg-plus.sh is derived from orbis-compat's scripts/ps4/make-pkg.sh and stays
under its MIT license.

It does NOT cover third-party code. Each patches/*.diff is a modification of another project
and stays under that project's license (LÖVE: zlib; LuaJIT: MIT; openal-soft: LGPL-2.1+).
Binary releases ship the third-party notices summarized in docs/release/THIRD_PARTY.md.
